window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b294-8f84ab9fa908d67a.json"]={sha256:"8f84ab9fa908d67a147203c18cc410f17a1b0b8d9bef50644aa04acd04d251e6",value:{"id":"b294","title":"船閘人字門安裝","titleEn":"Miter-gate installation for navigation locks","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以水壓傳力支承對位和機電幾何理解人字門安裝驗證。課程從邊界辨識與資料整理走到水理量化、構造介面及驗證紀錄；每一步把計算結果連回可量測的證據。十個不同單元分別處理關鍵機制，不以名義尺寸或單一通過率代替整體工程判斷，並明列合成算例與現地資料的差別。","summaryEn":"Understand miter-gate installation through pressure paths, bearing alignment and actuator geometry. The course moves from boundary identification and evidence to hydraulic quantification, structural interfaces and verification records. Ten distinct units connect each calculated quantity to measurable evidence. Nominal geometry or a single pass rate does not establish whole-system performance, and synthetic teaching examples remain separate from field observations.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-coasts","subcategoryTitle":"海岸、港灣與水資源韌性","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coasts, ports and water-resource resilience","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-coasts","learningTags":["water","water-coasts","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-lock","architectureNodes":[["雙側靜水荷載","Two-sided hydrostatic loading"],["面板跨距與彎曲","Skin-plate span and bending"],["樞軸名義承壓","Nominal pintle bearing pressure"],["熱伸縮與安裝基準","Thermal movement and installation reference"],["止水漏流與證據","Seal leakage and evidence"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-lock","labels":["雙側靜水荷載","面板跨距與彎曲","樞軸名義承壓","熱伸縮與安裝基準","止水漏流與證據"],"labelsEn":["Two-sided hydrostatic loading","Skin-plate span and bending","Nominal pintle bearing pressure","Thermal movement and installation reference","Seal leakage and evidence"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"以下為原創合成算例，不是地標工程的實測或推薦操作值。教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設淡水、同底面兩側深8與6m，垂直平面每米寬淨力F=ρg(8²−6²)/2=137.34kN/m；非致動器推力。假設上游水深8m增加10%至8.8m、下游仍6m，同底面每米淨水力由137.34變203.2632kN/m，增加48%；水頭與力不是線性同比關係。重新計算前先列固定條件、單位、適用尺度及可能失效的邊界。把模型敏感度與測量誤差分開，不能將單一參數變化直接當成工程風險或壽命比例。比較兩次結果後，記錄還需要哪些獨立證據，並由負責專業人員判斷適用性。","textEn":"This original synthetic example is neither a landmark measurement nor a recommended operating value. Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume freshwater and depths8and6m above the same base. Net force per metre of vertical plane is137.34kN/m, not actuator thrust. Increasing upper depth10% from8to8.8m while lower depth remains6m raises net force per metre from137.34 to203.2632kN/m, a48% increase; force does not change proportionally with depth. Before recalculating, list fixed conditions, units, applicable scale and boundaries that could fail. Separate model sensitivity from measurement uncertainty: a parameter change does not directly give a proportional change in engineering risk or service life. Compare the results, record independent evidence still needed, and have the responsible specialist determine applicability.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b294-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「雙側靜水荷載」與「門葉斜角與跨度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Two-sided hydrostatic loading\" and \"Leaf angle and projected span\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b294-v15-01","title":"雙側靜水荷載：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Two-sided hydrostatic loading: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「雙側靜水荷載」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Two-sided hydrostatic loading” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"人字門關閉後由門葉及接觸支承傳遞水壓，水壓分布需分別從兩側水深計算。每米寬的垂直平面條帶可以先建立荷載量級，但門葉斜角、水平主梁與接觸不連續會改變實際傳力；不能把條帶合力直接當成啟閉機的推力需求。 假設淡水、同底面兩側深8與6m，垂直平面每米寬淨力F=ρg(8²−6²)/2=137.34kN/m；非致動器推力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「雙側靜水荷載」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Closed miter gates transfer water pressure through leaves and contact supports, with pressure integrated separately for both water depths. A vertical plane strip per unit width provides an initial load scale. Leaf angle, horizontal girders and discontinuous contact alter real transfer, so the strip resultant cannot directly become the force required of the operating machinery during gate movement. Assume freshwater and depths8and6m above the same base. Net force per metre of vertical plane is137.34kN/m, not actuator thrust. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Two-sided hydrostatic loading” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「雙側靜水荷載」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Two-sided hydrostatic loading”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-01-k1","title":"雙側靜水荷載","titleEn":"Two-sided hydrostatic loading","text":"人字門關閉後由門葉及接觸支承傳遞水壓，水壓分布需分別從兩側水深計算。每米寬的垂直平面條帶可以先建立荷載量級，但門葉斜角、水平主梁與接觸不連續會改變實際傳力；不能把條帶合力直接當成啟閉機的推力需求。","textEn":"Closed miter gates transfer water pressure through leaves and contact supports, with pressure integrated separately for both water depths. A vertical plane strip per unit width provides an initial load scale.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雙側靜水荷載」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Two-sided hydrostatic loading\" is correct?","options":["閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。","人字門關閉後由門葉及接觸支承傳遞水壓，水壓分布需分別從兩側水深計算。","門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。"],"optionsEn":["The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis.","Closed miter gates transfer water pressure through leaves and contact supports, with pressure integrated separately for both water depths.","Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"人字門關閉後由門葉及接觸支承傳遞水壓，水壓分布需分別從兩側水深計算。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Closed miter gates transfer water pressure through leaves and contact supports, with pressure integrated separately for both water depths. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b294-v15-02","title":"雙側靜水荷載：定量估算","titleEn":"Two-sided hydrostatic loading: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「雙側靜水荷載」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Two-sided hydrostatic loading” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設淡水、同底面兩側深8與6m，垂直平面每米寬淨力F=ρg(8²−6²)/2=137.34kN/m；非致動器推力。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume freshwater and depths8and6m above the same base. Net force per metre of vertical plane is137.34kN/m, not actuator thrust. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫出兩側水壓圖與共同底面，將合力及力矩沿門葉傳到斜接及側枕接觸，確認單位寬度方向。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw both pressure diagrams on one base and trace resultant and moment through leaf, miter and quoin contacts, defining unit-width direction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設淡水、同底面兩側深8與6m，垂直平面每米寬淨力F=ρg(8²−6²)/2=137.34kN/m；非致動器推力。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume freshwater and depths8and6m above the same base. Net force per metre of vertical plane is137.34kN/m, not actuator thrust.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雙側靜水荷載」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Two-sided hydrostatic loading\", which statement holds?","options":["排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。","上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence.","Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b294-v15-03","title":"雙側靜水荷載：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Two-sided hydrostatic loading: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「雙側靜水荷載」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Two-sided hydrostatic loading” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫出兩側水壓圖與共同底面，將合力及力矩沿門葉傳到斜接及側枕接觸，確認單位寬度方向。另查啟閉時水頭條件和機械阻力，不能將閉門受力直接當操作工況。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw both pressure diagrams on one base and trace resultant and moment through leaf, miter and quoin contacts, defining unit-width direction. Review head and resistance during movement separately rather than substituting the closed-gate load case for an operating condition. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出兩側水壓圖與共同底面，將合力及力矩沿門葉傳到斜接及側枕接觸，確認單位寬度方向。另查啟閉時水頭條件和機械阻力，不能將閉門受力直接當操作工況。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw both pressure diagrams on one base and trace resultant and moment through leaf, miter and quoin contacts, defining unit-width direction. Review head and resistance during movement separately rather than substituting the closed-gate load case for an operating condition.","failure":"注意干擾：只用水位差乘總面積會錯估三角形分布，漏掉下游水壓又會高估淨力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using head difference times total area misses the triangular distribution, while omitted downstream pressure overstates net force. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫出兩側水壓圖與共同底面，將合力及力矩沿門葉傳到斜接及側枕接觸，確認單位寬度方向。另查啟閉時水頭條件和機械阻力，不能將閉門受力直接當操作工況。","textEn":"Draw both pressure diagrams on one base and trace resultant and moment through leaf, miter and quoin contacts, defining unit-width direction. Review head and resistance during movement separately rather than substituting the closed-gate load case for an operating condition.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出兩側水壓圖與共同底面，將合力及力矩沿門葉傳到斜接及側枕接觸，確認單位寬度方向。另查啟閉時水頭條件和機械阻力，不能將閉門受力直接當操作工況。","textEn":"Draw both pressure diagrams on one base and trace resultant and moment through leaf, miter and quoin contacts, defining unit-width direction. Review head and resistance during movement separately rather than substituting the closed-gate load case for an operating condition.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雙側靜水荷載」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Two-sided hydrostatic loading\"?","options":["畫出兩側水壓圖與共同底面，將合力及力矩沿門葉傳到斜接及側枕接觸，確認單位寬度方向。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。"],"optionsEn":["Draw both pressure diagrams on one base and trace resultant and moment through leaf, miter and quoin contacts, defining unit-width direction.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction."],"answer":0,"explanation":"畫出兩側水壓圖與共同底面，將合力及力矩沿門葉傳到斜接及側枕接觸，確認單位寬度方向。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw both pressure diagrams on one base and trace resultant and moment through leaf, miter and quoin contacts, defining unit-width direction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b294-v15-04","title":"雙側靜水荷載：失效診斷","titleEn":"Two-sided hydrostatic loading: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「雙側靜水荷載」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Two-sided hydrostatic loading” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只用水位差乘總面積會錯估三角形分布，漏掉下游水壓又會高估淨力。支承接觸失效時荷載路徑改變，原本有效的簡化靜力模型也可能不再成立。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using head difference times total area misses the triangular distribution, while omitted downstream pressure overstates net force. Lost support contact changes the load path and can invalidate a previously appropriate simplified static representation. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設淡水、同底面兩側深8與6m，垂直平面每米寬淨力F=ρg(8²−6²)/2=137.34kN/m；非致動器推力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Net force per metre of vertical plane is137.34kN/m, not actuator thrust.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只用水位差乘總面積會錯估三角形分布，漏掉下游水壓又會高估淨力。支承接觸失效時荷載路徑改變，原本有效的簡化靜力模型也可能不再成立。","textEn":"Using head difference times total area misses the triangular distribution, while omitted downstream pressure overstates net force. Lost support contact changes the load path and can invalidate a previously appropriate simplified static representation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雙側靜水荷載」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Two-sided hydrostatic loading\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只用水位差乘總面積會錯估三角形分布，漏掉下游水壓又會高估淨力。","門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Using head difference times total area misses the triangular distribution, while omitted downstream pressure overstates net force.","Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只用水位差乘總面積會錯估三角形分布，漏掉下游水壓又會高估淨力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using head difference times total area misses the triangular distribution, while omitted downstream pressure overstates net force. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b294-v15-05","title":"門葉斜角與跨度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Leaf angle and projected span: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「門葉斜角與跨度」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Leaf angle and projected span” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"人字門兩葉形成上游指向的平面幾何，門葉實長與航道橫向半寬不同。斜角影響斜接位置、接觸及受力，但幾何一致不代表支承壓力已均勻；測量應分開閉合位置與轉動包絡，避免用設計投影尺寸直接安排吊運或調整作業。 假設開口寬20m、各葉與橫向成20°，葉長l=10/cos20°=10.6418m，上游突出10tan20°=3.6397m；忽略接縫細節。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「門葉斜角與跨度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Two leaves form an upstream-pointing plan geometry, with leaf length different from half the transverse opening. Angle affects miter position, contacts and force transfer, but geometric agreement does not establish uniform bearing. Surveys must distinguish closure position from the swept motion envelope rather than using projected design dimensions alone to plan lifting or field adjustment of the gate assembly. Assume opening20m and each leaf20°from transverse. Leaf length=10.6418m and upstream projection=3.6397m, excluding joint and hinge details. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Leaf angle and projected span” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「門葉斜角與跨度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Leaf angle and projected span”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-05-k1","title":"門葉斜角與跨度","titleEn":"Leaf angle and projected span","text":"人字門兩葉形成上游指向的平面幾何，門葉實長與航道橫向半寬不同。斜角影響斜接位置、接觸及受力，但幾何一致不代表支承壓力已均勻；測量應分開閉合位置與轉動包絡，避免用設計投影尺寸直接安排吊運或調整作業。","textEn":"Two leaves form an upstream-pointing plan geometry, with leaf length different from half the transverse opening. Angle affects miter position, contacts and force transfer, but geometric agreement does not establish uniform bearing.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「門葉斜角與跨度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Leaf angle and projected span\" is correct?","options":["門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。","整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。","人字門兩葉形成上游指向的平面幾何，門葉實長與航道橫向半寬不同。"],"optionsEn":["Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle.","Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress.","Two leaves form an upstream-pointing plan geometry, with leaf length different from half the transverse opening."],"answer":2,"explanation":"人字門兩葉形成上游指向的平面幾何，門葉實長與航道橫向半寬不同。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Two leaves form an upstream-pointing plan geometry, with leaf length different from half the transverse opening. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b294-v15-06","title":"門葉斜角與跨度：定量估算","titleEn":"Leaf angle and projected span: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「門葉斜角與跨度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Leaf angle and projected span” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設開口寬20m、各葉與橫向成20°，葉長l=10/cos20°=10.6418m，上游突出10tan20°=3.6397m；忽略接縫細節。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume opening20m and each leaf20°from transverse. Leaf length=10.6418m and upstream projection=3.6397m, excluding joint and hinge details. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：在同一平面座標標出轉軸、斜接點和牆側接觸，分別核對投影與實長。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Locate hinges, miter and wall contacts in one coordinate system, checking projected and actual lengths separately.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設開口寬20m、各葉與橫向成20°，葉長l=10/cos20°=10.6418m，上游突出10tan20°=3.6397m；忽略接縫細節。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume opening20m and each leaf20°from transverse. Leaf length=10.6418m and upstream projection=3.6397m, excluding joint and hinge details.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「門葉斜角與跨度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Leaf angle and projected span\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。","氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point.","Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b294-v15-07","title":"門葉斜角與跨度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Leaf angle and projected span: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「門葉斜角與跨度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Leaf angle and projected span” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"在同一平面座標標出轉軸、斜接點和牆側接觸，分別核對投影與實長。用獨立測站檢查閉合輪廓，另畫轉動間隙與埋件位置，將幾何誤差追溯到特定構件而非現場硬推。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Locate hinges, miter and wall contacts in one coordinate system, checking projected and actual lengths separately. Independently survey the closed outline and swept clearances, tracing discrepancies to specific components rather than forcing the assembly into place based only on nominal dimensions. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：在同一平面座標標出轉軸、斜接點和牆側接觸，分別核對投影與實長。用獨立測站檢查閉合輪廓，另畫轉動間隙與埋件位置，將幾何誤差追溯到特定構件而非現場硬推。","observationEn":"Site practice: Locate hinges, miter and wall contacts in one coordinate system, checking projected and actual lengths separately. Independently survey the closed outline and swept clearances, tracing discrepancies to specific components rather than forcing the assembly into place based only on nominal dimensions.","failure":"注意干擾：角度基準弄錯會使門葉實長和上游突出同時偏差，兩邊轉軸不共基準又造成斜接無法對齊。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An incorrect angular reference misstates both length and upstream projection, while inconsistent hinge coordinates prevent miter alignment. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在同一平面座標標出轉軸、斜接點和牆側接觸，分別核對投影與實長。用獨立測站檢查閉合輪廓，另畫轉動間隙與埋件位置，將幾何誤差追溯到特定構件而非現場硬推。","textEn":"Locate hinges, miter and wall contacts in one coordinate system, checking projected and actual lengths separately. Independently survey the closed outline and swept clearances, tracing discrepancies to specific components rather than forcing the assembly into place based only on nominal dimensions.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"在同一平面座標標出轉軸、斜接點和牆側接觸，分別核對投影與實長。用獨立測站檢查閉合輪廓，另畫轉動間隙與埋件位置，將幾何誤差追溯到特定構件而非現場硬推。","textEn":"Locate hinges, miter and wall contacts in one coordinate system, checking projected and actual lengths separately. Independently survey the closed outline and swept clearances, tracing discrepancies to specific components rather than forcing the assembly into place based only on nominal dimensions.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「門葉斜角與跨度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Leaf angle and projected span\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","在同一平面座標標出轉軸、斜接點和牆側接觸，分別核對投影與實長。","油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Locate hinges, miter and wall contacts in one coordinate system, checking projected and actual lengths separately.","Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight."],"answer":1,"explanation":"在同一平面座標標出轉軸、斜接點和牆側接觸，分別核對投影與實長。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Locate hinges, miter and wall contacts in one coordinate system, checking projected and actual lengths separately. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b294-v15-08","title":"門葉斜角與跨度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Leaf angle and projected span: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「門葉斜角與跨度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Leaf angle and projected span” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"角度基準弄錯會使門葉實長和上游突出同時偏差，兩邊轉軸不共基準又造成斜接無法對齊。強行閉合可能把幾何誤差轉成支承局部負荷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An incorrect angular reference misstates both length and upstream projection, while inconsistent hinge coordinates prevent miter alignment. Forced closure can convert a geometric mismatch into concentrated loading at bearings or contact surfaces within the assembly. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設開口寬20m、各葉與橫向成20°，葉長l=10/cos20°=10.6418m，上游突出10tan20°=3.6397m；忽略接縫細節。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Leaf length=10.6418m and upstream projection=3.6397m, excluding joint and hinge details.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"角度基準弄錯會使門葉實長和上游突出同時偏差，兩邊轉軸不共基準又造成斜接無法對齊。強行閉合可能把幾何誤差轉成支承局部負荷。","textEn":"An incorrect angular reference misstates both length and upstream projection, while inconsistent hinge coordinates prevent miter alignment. Forced closure can convert a geometric mismatch into concentrated loading at bearings or contact surfaces within the assembly.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「門葉斜角與跨度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Leaf angle and projected span\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。","角度基準弄錯會使門葉實長和上游突出同時偏差，兩邊轉軸不共基準又造成斜接無法對齊。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress.","An incorrect angular reference misstates both length and upstream projection, while inconsistent hinge coordinates prevent miter alignment."],"answer":2,"explanation":"角度基準弄錯會使門葉實長和上游突出同時偏差，兩邊轉軸不共基準又造成斜接無法對齊。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An incorrect angular reference misstates both length and upstream projection, while inconsistent hinge coordinates prevent miter alignment. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b294-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「面板跨距與彎曲」與「浮力與支承自重」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Skin-plate span and bending\" and \"Buoyancy and supported weight\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b294-v15-09","title":"面板跨距與彎曲：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Skin-plate span and bending: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「面板跨距與彎曲」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Skin-plate span and bending” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"面板將局部水壓傳給加勁材，支承距離與邊界條件決定彎曲而非只看整扇門重量。一米寬簡支條帶忽略雙向板作用和焊接約束，只能建立比較基準；腐蝕減薄、初始變形與接觸細節會改變局部反應，需要與實際板格配置對照。 假設一米寬簡支條帶p=100kPa、跨0.50m、厚0.020m，M=pL²/8=3.125kN·m/m，σ=6M/t²=46.875MPa。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「面板跨距與彎曲」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The skin plate transfers local pressure to stiffeners, with span and restraint governing bending rather than whole-gate weight. A simply supported unit-width strip omits two-way plate behavior and welded restraint, providing a comparison baseline only. Corrosion loss, initial distortion and connection details modify local response and must be checked against the actual panel arrangement rather than assumed away. Assume a unit-width simply supported strip,p=100kPa,span0.50m,thickness0.020m. M=3.125kN·m/m and elasticσ=46.875MPa, excluding two-way action. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Skin-plate span and bending” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「面板跨距與彎曲」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Skin-plate span and bending”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-09-k1","title":"面板跨距與彎曲","titleEn":"Skin-plate span and bending","text":"面板將局部水壓傳給加勁材，支承距離與邊界條件決定彎曲而非只看整扇門重量。一米寬簡支條帶忽略雙向板作用和焊接約束，只能建立比較基準；腐蝕減薄、初始變形與接觸細節會改變局部反應，需要與實際板格配置對照。","textEn":"The skin plate transfers local pressure to stiffeners, with span and restraint governing bending rather than whole-gate weight. A simply supported unit-width strip omits two-way plate behavior and welded restraint, providing a comparison baseline only.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「面板跨距與彎曲」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Skin-plate span and bending\" is correct?","options":["面板將局部水壓傳給加勁材，支承距離與邊界條件決定彎曲而非只看整扇門重量。","整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。","排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。"],"optionsEn":["The skin plate transfers local pressure to stiffeners, with span and restraint governing bending rather than whole-gate weight.","Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress.","After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"面板將局部水壓傳給加勁材，支承距離與邊界條件決定彎曲而非只看整扇門重量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The skin plate transfers local pressure to stiffeners, with span and restraint governing bending rather than whole-gate weight. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b294-v15-10","title":"面板跨距與彎曲：定量估算","titleEn":"Skin-plate span and bending: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「面板跨距與彎曲」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Skin-plate span and bending” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設一米寬簡支條帶p=100kPa、跨0.50m、厚0.020m，M=pL²/8=3.125kN·m/m，σ=6M/t²=46.875MPa。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a unit-width simply supported strip,p=100kPa,span0.50m,thickness0.020m. M=3.125kN·m/m and elasticσ=46.875MPa, excluding two-way action. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對板格淨跨與焊接支承，量測實際最薄厚度並標示水壓取值的深度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check clear panel span and welded restraint, measuring minimum thickness and locating the pressure depth.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設一米寬簡支條帶p=100kPa、跨0.50m、厚0.020m，M=pL²/8=3.125kN·m/m，σ=6M/t²=46.875MPa。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume a unit-width simply supported strip,p=100kPa,span0.50m,thickness0.020m. M=3.125kN·m/m and elasticσ=46.875MPa, excluding two-way action.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「面板跨距與彎曲」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Skin-plate span and bending\", which statement holds?","options":["上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。"],"optionsEn":["Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b294-v15-11","title":"面板跨距與彎曲：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Skin-plate span and bending: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「面板跨距與彎曲」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Skin-plate span and bending” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對板格淨跨與焊接支承，量測實際最薄厚度並標示水壓取值的深度。將條帶與適用板模型比較，另查焊縫和加勁材傳力，不以平均門葉厚度代替控制板格尺寸。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check clear panel span and welded restraint, measuring minimum thickness and locating the pressure depth. Compare the strip with an appropriate plate model and inspect weld and stiffener transfer, avoiding substitution of an average leaf thickness for the dimensions of the controlling panel. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：核對板格淨跨與焊接支承，量測實際最薄厚度並標示水壓取值的深度。將條帶與適用板模型比較，另查焊縫和加勁材傳力，不以平均門葉厚度代替控制板格尺寸。","observationEn":"Site practice: Check clear panel span and welded restraint, measuring minimum thickness and locating the pressure depth. Compare the strip with an appropriate plate model and inspect weld and stiffener transfer, avoiding substitution of an average leaf thickness for the dimensions of the controlling panel.","failure":"注意干擾：跨距增加會按平方放大條帶彎矩，局部厚度減少又快速增加應力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Longer spans increase strip moment quadratically, and localized thinning rapidly raises stress. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對板格淨跨與焊接支承，量測實際最薄厚度並標示水壓取值的深度。將條帶與適用板模型比較，另查焊縫和加勁材傳力，不以平均門葉厚度代替控制板格尺寸。","textEn":"Check clear panel span and welded restraint, measuring minimum thickness and locating the pressure depth. Compare the strip with an appropriate plate model and inspect weld and stiffener transfer, avoiding substitution of an average leaf thickness for the dimensions of the controlling panel.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"核對板格淨跨與焊接支承，量測實際最薄厚度並標示水壓取值的深度。將條帶與適用板模型比較，另查焊縫和加勁材傳力，不以平均門葉厚度代替控制板格尺寸。","textEn":"Check clear panel span and welded restraint, measuring minimum thickness and locating the pressure depth. Compare the strip with an appropriate plate model and inspect weld and stiffener transfer, avoiding substitution of an average leaf thickness for the dimensions of the controlling panel.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「面板跨距與彎曲」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Skin-plate span and bending\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。","核對板格淨跨與焊接支承，量測實際最薄厚度並標示水壓取值的深度。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head.","Check clear panel span and welded restraint, measuring minimum thickness and locating the pressure depth."],"answer":2,"explanation":"核對板格淨跨與焊接支承，量測實際最薄厚度並標示水壓取值的深度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check clear panel span and welded restraint, measuring minimum thickness and locating the pressure depth. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b294-v15-12","title":"面板跨距與彎曲：失效診斷","titleEn":"Skin-plate span and bending: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「面板跨距與彎曲」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Skin-plate span and bending” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"跨距增加會按平方放大條帶彎矩，局部厚度減少又快速增加應力。忽略焊接約束或初始波浪形可能改變應力位置，整體門葉位移小也不排除局部板格問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Longer spans increase strip moment quadratically, and localized thinning rapidly raises stress. Weld restraint or initial waviness can relocate stress concentrations; small overall leaf movement does not exclude a problem in an individual skin panel. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設一米寬簡支條帶p=100kPa、跨0.50m、厚0.020m，M=pL²/8=3.125kN·m/m，σ=6M/t²=46.875MPa。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: M=3.125kN·m/m and elasticσ=46.875MPa, excluding two-way action.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"跨距增加會按平方放大條帶彎矩，局部厚度減少又快速增加應力。忽略焊接約束或初始波浪形可能改變應力位置，整體門葉位移小也不排除局部板格問題。","textEn":"Longer spans increase strip moment quadratically, and localized thinning rapidly raises stress. Weld restraint or initial waviness can relocate stress concentrations; small overall leaf movement does not exclude a problem in an individual skin panel.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「面板跨距與彎曲」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Skin-plate span and bending\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["跨距增加會按平方放大條帶彎矩，局部厚度減少又快速增加應力。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。"],"optionsEn":["Longer spans increase strip moment quadratically, and localized thinning rapidly raises stress.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"跨距增加會按平方放大條帶彎矩，局部厚度減少又快速增加應力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Longer spans increase strip moment quadratically, and localized thinning rapidly raises stress. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b294-v15-13","title":"浮力與支承自重：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Buoyancy and supported weight: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「浮力與支承自重」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Buoyancy and supported weight” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"門葉在水中與排水檢修時的有效重量不同，密閉艙浮力與材料體積不能混用。支承分擔還取決於重心、浮心及上部約束，重量差只給垂直合力；若有漏水或排氣狀態改變，浮力邊界會更新，不能沿用安裝初期的固定值。 假設門葉質量200000kg、密閉排水體積50m³、淡水1000kg/m³，淨向下力(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN；未分配各支承。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「浮力與支承自重」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Effective supported weight differs between submerged operation and dewatered maintenance. Buoyancy of sealed spaces must not be confused with material volume, while support sharing depends on gravity center, buoyancy center and upper restraint. A weight difference gives only the vertical resultant. Flooding or ventilation changes the buoyancy boundary, so an initial value cannot be retained unchanged through every installation state. Assume gate mass200000kg,sealed displacement50m³ and freshwater1000kg/m³. Net downward force=(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN, before distribution among supports. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Buoyancy and supported weight” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「浮力與支承自重」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Buoyancy and supported weight”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-13-k1","title":"浮力與支承自重","titleEn":"Buoyancy and supported weight","text":"門葉在水中與排水檢修時的有效重量不同，密閉艙浮力與材料體積不能混用。支承分擔還取決於重心、浮心及上部約束，重量差只給垂直合力；若有漏水或排氣狀態改變，浮力邊界會更新，不能沿用安裝初期的固定值。","textEn":"Effective supported weight differs between submerged operation and dewatered maintenance. Buoyancy of sealed spaces must not be confused with material volume, while support sharing depends on gravity center, buoyancy center and upper restraint.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「浮力與支承自重」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Buoyancy and supported weight\" is correct?","options":["排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。","門葉在水中與排水檢修時的有效重量不同，密閉艙浮力與材料體積不能混用。","名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。"],"optionsEn":["After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence.","Effective supported weight differs between submerged operation and dewatered maintenance.","Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point."],"answer":1,"explanation":"門葉在水中與排水檢修時的有效重量不同，密閉艙浮力與材料體積不能混用。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Effective supported weight differs between submerged operation and dewatered maintenance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b294-v15-14","title":"浮力與支承自重：定量估算","titleEn":"Buoyancy and supported weight: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「浮力與支承自重」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Buoyancy and supported weight” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設門葉質量200000kg、密閉排水體積50m³、淡水1000kg/m³，淨向下力(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN；未分配各支承。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume gate mass200000kg,sealed displacement50m³ and freshwater1000kg/m³. Net downward force=(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN, before distribution among supports. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：逐艙核對密閉、通氣與進水狀態，記錄重心和浮心位置，畫完整垂直受力圖。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Verify compartment sealing, ventilation and flooding, recording gravity and buoyancy centers on a complete free-body diagram.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設門葉質量200000kg、密閉排水體積50m³、淡水1000kg/m³，淨向下力(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN；未分配各支承。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume gate mass200000kg,sealed displacement50m³ and freshwater1000kg/m³. Net downward force=(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN, before distribution among supports.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「浮力與支承自重」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Buoyancy and supported weight\", which statement holds?","options":["氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。","油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate.","Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b294-v15-15","title":"浮力與支承自重：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Buoyancy and supported weight: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「浮力與支承自重」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Buoyancy and supported weight” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"逐艙核對密閉、通氣與進水狀態，記錄重心和浮心位置，畫完整垂直受力圖。分開乾態與水中檢查，將實際支承反力或變形與模型比較，不把總淨重平均分到所有接點。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Verify compartment sealing, ventilation and flooding, recording gravity and buoyancy centers on a complete free-body diagram. Check dry and submerged states separately and compare support response with the model instead of dividing total net weight equally among all attachment points. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：逐艙核對密閉、通氣與進水狀態，記錄重心和浮心位置，畫完整垂直受力圖。分開乾態與水中檢查，將實際支承反力或變形與模型比較，不把總淨重平均分到所有接點。","observationEn":"Site practice: Verify compartment sealing, ventilation and flooding, recording gravity and buoyancy centers on a complete free-body diagram. Check dry and submerged states separately and compare support response with the model instead of dividing total net weight equally among all attachment points.","failure":"注意干擾：艙室進水會降低浮力並增加支承需求，排水檢修則可能恢復全部乾重量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Flooding reduces buoyancy and increases supported load, while dewatering can restore full dry weight. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐艙核對密閉、通氣與進水狀態，記錄重心和浮心位置，畫完整垂直受力圖。分開乾態與水中檢查，將實際支承反力或變形與模型比較，不把總淨重平均分到所有接點。","textEn":"Verify compartment sealing, ventilation and flooding, recording gravity and buoyancy centers on a complete free-body diagram. Check dry and submerged states separately and compare support response with the model instead of dividing total net weight equally among all attachment points.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"逐艙核對密閉、通氣與進水狀態，記錄重心和浮心位置，畫完整垂直受力圖。分開乾態與水中檢查，將實際支承反力或變形與模型比較，不把總淨重平均分到所有接點。","textEn":"Verify compartment sealing, ventilation and flooding, recording gravity and buoyancy centers on a complete free-body diagram. Check dry and submerged states separately and compare support response with the model instead of dividing total net weight equally among all attachment points.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「浮力與支承自重」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Buoyancy and supported weight\"?","options":["逐艙核對密閉、通氣與進水狀態，記錄重心和浮心位置，畫完整垂直受力圖。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。"],"optionsEn":["Verify compartment sealing, ventilation and flooding, recording gravity and buoyancy centers on a complete free-body diagram.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis."],"answer":0,"explanation":"逐艙核對密閉、通氣與進水狀態，記錄重心和浮心位置，畫完整垂直受力圖。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Verify compartment sealing, ventilation and flooding, recording gravity and buoyancy centers on a complete free-body diagram. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b294-v15-16","title":"浮力與支承自重：失效診斷","titleEn":"Buoyancy and supported weight: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「浮力與支承自重」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Buoyancy and supported weight” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"艙室進水會降低浮力並增加支承需求，排水檢修則可能恢復全部乾重量。若仍用水中淨重評估乾態臨時支承，會漏掉安裝或維護轉換中的關鍵負荷。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Flooding reduces buoyancy and increases supported load, while dewatering can restore full dry weight. Assessing temporary dry-state supports using submerged effective weight misses a critical load change during installation or maintenance transitions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設門葉質量200000kg、密閉排水體積50m³、淡水1000kg/m³，淨向下力(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN；未分配各支承。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Net downward force=(m−ρV)g=1471.5kN, before distribution among supports.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"艙室進水會降低浮力並增加支承需求，排水檢修則可能恢復全部乾重量。若仍用水中淨重評估乾態臨時支承，會漏掉安裝或維護轉換中的關鍵負荷。","textEn":"Flooding reduces buoyancy and increases supported load, while dewatering can restore full dry weight. Assessing temporary dry-state supports using submerged effective weight misses a critical load change during installation or maintenance transitions.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「浮力與支承自重」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Buoyancy and supported weight\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","艙室進水會降低浮力並增加支承需求，排水檢修則可能恢復全部乾重量。","名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Flooding reduces buoyancy and increases supported load, while dewatering can restore full dry weight.","Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point."],"answer":1,"explanation":"艙室進水會降低浮力並增加支承需求，排水檢修則可能恢復全部乾重量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Flooding reduces buoyancy and increases supported load, while dewatering can restore full dry weight. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b294-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「樞軸名義承壓」與「轉軸對位與垂直度」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Nominal pintle bearing pressure\" and \"Hinge alignment and plumbness\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b294-v15-17","title":"樞軸名義承壓：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Nominal pintle bearing pressure: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「樞軸名義承壓」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Nominal pintle bearing pressure” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"樞軸將門葉作用傳入底部埋件，名義承壓可以用投影面積估量，但不是實際接觸峰值。軸承曲面、間隙、潤滑和偏心會集中壓力，局部磨耗又反過來改變對位；應把承壓需求與材料、接觸及固定系統的驗證分開，不靠一個平均值判定可用。 假設徑向合力1.5MN、投影直徑0.30m、有效承壓長0.40m，pnom=R/(DL)=12.50MPa；非赫茲接觸峰壓。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「樞軸名義承壓」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The pintle transfers gate action into embedded support. Projected-area pressure is a nominal scale, not the actual contact maximum. Curvature, clearance, lubrication and eccentricity concentrate pressure, while wear feeds back into alignment. Demand must therefore be evaluated with material, contact and anchorage evidence rather than using a single average number to declare the complete bearing assembly suitable for service. Assume radial resultant1.5MN,projected diameter0.30m and bearing length0.40m. Nominal pressure R/(DL)=12.50MPa, not Hertzian peak contact pressure. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Nominal pintle bearing pressure” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「樞軸名義承壓」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Nominal pintle bearing pressure”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-17-k1","title":"樞軸名義承壓","titleEn":"Nominal pintle bearing pressure","text":"樞軸將門葉作用傳入底部埋件，名義承壓可以用投影面積估量，但不是實際接觸峰值。軸承曲面、間隙、潤滑和偏心會集中壓力，局部磨耗又反過來改變對位；應把承壓需求與材料、接觸及固定系統的驗證分開，不靠一個平均值判定可用。","textEn":"The pintle transfers gate action into embedded support. Projected-area pressure is a nominal scale, not the actual contact maximum.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「樞軸名義承壓」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Nominal pintle bearing pressure\" is correct?","options":["名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。","上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。","樞軸將門葉作用傳入底部埋件，名義承壓可以用投影面積估量，但不是實際接觸峰值。"],"optionsEn":["Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point.","Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.","The pintle transfers gate action into embedded support."],"answer":2,"explanation":"樞軸將門葉作用傳入底部埋件，名義承壓可以用投影面積估量，但不是實際接觸峰值。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The pintle transfers gate action into embedded support. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b294-v15-18","title":"樞軸名義承壓：定量估算","titleEn":"Nominal pintle bearing pressure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「樞軸名義承壓」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Nominal pintle bearing pressure” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設徑向合力1.5MN、投影直徑0.30m、有效承壓長0.40m，pnom=R/(DL)=12.50MPa；非赫茲接觸峰壓。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume radial resultant1.5MN,projected diameter0.30m and bearing length0.40m. Nominal pressure R/(DL)=12.50MPa, not Hertzian peak contact pressure. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：確認合力方向與實際接觸型式，核對有效長度、間隙和表面狀態，保留潤滑紀錄。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Confirm resultant direction and actual contact type, checking effective length, clearance and surface condition with lubrication records.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設徑向合力1.5MN、投影直徑0.30m、有效承壓長0.40m，pnom=R/(DL)=12.50MPa；非赫茲接觸峰壓。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume radial resultant1.5MN,projected diameter0.30m and bearing length0.40m. Nominal pressure R/(DL)=12.50MPa, not Hertzian peak contact pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「樞軸名義承壓」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Nominal pintle bearing pressure\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。","修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction.","Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b294-v15-19","title":"樞軸名義承壓：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Nominal pintle bearing pressure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「樞軸名義承壓」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Nominal pintle bearing pressure” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"確認合力方向與實際接觸型式，核對有效長度、間隙和表面狀態，保留潤滑紀錄。用磨耗圖和對位量測檢查偏載，另評估埋件與錨定傳力，不將投影面壓當完整接觸分析。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Confirm resultant direction and actual contact type, checking effective length, clearance and surface condition with lubrication records. Compare wear patterns and alignment for eccentric loading and review embedded anchorage transfer separately from the simplified projected-pressure calculation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：確認合力方向與實際接觸型式，核對有效長度、間隙和表面狀態，保留潤滑紀錄。用磨耗圖和對位量測檢查偏載，另評估埋件與錨定傳力，不將投影面壓當完整接觸分析。","observationEn":"Site practice: Confirm resultant direction and actual contact type, checking effective length, clearance and surface condition with lubrication records. Compare wear patterns and alignment for eccentric loading and review embedded anchorage transfer separately from the simplified projected-pressure calculation.","failure":"注意干擾：軸承邊緣接觸可能在平均面壓正常時產生高峰值，潤滑不足又加速磨耗。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Edge contact produces high local pressure despite a normal average, and poor lubrication accelerates wear. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"確認合力方向與實際接觸型式，核對有效長度、間隙和表面狀態，保留潤滑紀錄。用磨耗圖和對位量測檢查偏載，另評估埋件與錨定傳力，不將投影面壓當完整接觸分析。","textEn":"Confirm resultant direction and actual contact type, checking effective length, clearance and surface condition with lubrication records. Compare wear patterns and alignment for eccentric loading and review embedded anchorage transfer separately from the simplified projected-pressure calculation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"確認合力方向與實際接觸型式，核對有效長度、間隙和表面狀態，保留潤滑紀錄。用磨耗圖和對位量測檢查偏載，另評估埋件與錨定傳力，不將投影面壓當完整接觸分析。","textEn":"Confirm resultant direction and actual contact type, checking effective length, clearance and surface condition with lubrication records. Compare wear patterns and alignment for eccentric loading and review embedded anchorage transfer separately from the simplified projected-pressure calculation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「樞軸名義承壓」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Nominal pintle bearing pressure\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","確認合力方向與實際接觸型式，核對有效長度、間隙和表面狀態，保留潤滑紀錄。","門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Confirm resultant direction and actual contact type, checking effective length, clearance and surface condition with lubrication records.","Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"確認合力方向與實際接觸型式，核對有效長度、間隙和表面狀態，保留潤滑紀錄。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Confirm resultant direction and actual contact type, checking effective length, clearance and surface condition with lubrication records. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b294-v15-20","title":"樞軸名義承壓：失效診斷","titleEn":"Nominal pintle bearing pressure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「樞軸名義承壓」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Nominal pintle bearing pressure” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"軸承邊緣接觸可能在平均面壓正常時產生高峰值，潤滑不足又加速磨耗。磨耗後轉軸移動會連帶改變門葉斜接，局部問題可能擴大成整門閉合異常。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Edge contact produces high local pressure despite a normal average, and poor lubrication accelerates wear. Subsequent hinge movement changes miter alignment, allowing a local bearing issue to develop into abnormal closure of the full gate. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設徑向合力1.5MN、投影直徑0.30m、有效承壓長0.40m，pnom=R/(DL)=12.50MPa；非赫茲接觸峰壓。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Nominal pressure R/(DL)=12.50MPa, not Hertzian peak contact pressure.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"軸承邊緣接觸可能在平均面壓正常時產生高峰值，潤滑不足又加速磨耗。磨耗後轉軸移動會連帶改變門葉斜接，局部問題可能擴大成整門閉合異常。","textEn":"Edge contact produces high local pressure despite a normal average, and poor lubrication accelerates wear. Subsequent hinge movement changes miter alignment, allowing a local bearing issue to develop into abnormal closure of the full gate.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「樞軸名義承壓」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Nominal pintle bearing pressure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。","軸承邊緣接觸可能在平均面壓正常時產生高峰值，潤滑不足又加速磨耗。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.","Edge contact produces high local pressure despite a normal average, and poor lubrication accelerates wear."],"answer":2,"explanation":"軸承邊緣接觸可能在平均面壓正常時產生高峰值，潤滑不足又加速磨耗。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Edge contact produces high local pressure despite a normal average, and poor lubrication accelerates wear. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b294-v15-21","title":"轉軸對位與垂直度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Hinge alignment and plumbness: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「轉軸對位與垂直度」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Hinge alignment and plumbness” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"上下轉軸相對偏移會改變轉動阻力及門葉接觸，角度很小仍可能在長門葉上放大位移。兩點幾何只能描述整體傾斜，不能辨識軸彎曲或埋件局部變形；量測需要共同穩定基準並補中間點，避免把溫度或儀器漂移誤認為永久錯位。 假設上下測點高差15m、水平偏移3mm，θ≈0.003/15=0.0002rad=0.01146°；只描述兩點整體傾斜。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「轉軸對位與垂直度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Relative offset between upper and lower pivots changes rotation and leaf contact, and a small angle can create appreciable movement along a large leaf. Two points describe overall tilt but not shaft curvature or local embedment deformation. Stable common control and intermediate observations are needed to distinguish true misalignment from temperature effects or instrument drift during installation verification. Assume pivot points15m vertically apart with horizontal offset3mm. Tilt≈0.0002rad=0.01146°, describing only the overall two-point alignment. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Hinge alignment and plumbness” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「轉軸對位與垂直度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Hinge alignment and plumbness”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-21-k1","title":"轉軸對位與垂直度","titleEn":"Hinge alignment and plumbness","text":"上下轉軸相對偏移會改變轉動阻力及門葉接觸，角度很小仍可能在長門葉上放大位移。兩點幾何只能描述整體傾斜，不能辨識軸彎曲或埋件局部變形；量測需要共同穩定基準並補中間點，避免把溫度或儀器漂移誤認為永久錯位。","textEn":"Relative offset between upper and lower pivots changes rotation and leaf contact, and a small angle can create appreciable movement along a large leaf. Two points describe overall tilt but not shaft curvature or local embedment deformation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「轉軸對位與垂直度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Hinge alignment and plumbness\" is correct?","options":["上下轉軸相對偏移會改變轉動阻力及門葉接觸，角度很小仍可能在長門葉上放大位移。","上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。","氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。"],"optionsEn":["Relative offset between upper and lower pivots changes rotation and leaf contact, and a small angle can create appreciable movement along a large leaf.","Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.","Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"上下轉軸相對偏移會改變轉動阻力及門葉接觸，角度很小仍可能在長門葉上放大位移。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Relative offset between upper and lower pivots changes rotation and leaf contact, and a small angle can create appreciable movement along a large leaf. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b294-v15-22","title":"轉軸對位與垂直度：定量估算","titleEn":"Hinge alignment and plumbness: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「轉軸對位與垂直度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Hinge alignment and plumbness” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設上下測點高差15m、水平偏移3mm，θ≈0.003/15=0.0002rad=0.01146°；只描述兩點整體傾斜。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume pivot points15m vertically apart with horizontal offset3mm. Tilt≈0.0002rad=0.01146°, describing only the overall two-point alignment. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以獨立控制點重測上下與中間位置，保存溫度和受力狀態，分開整體傾斜與局部殘差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Resurvey upper, intermediate and lower points from independent control with temperature and loading recorded.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設上下測點高差15m、水平偏移3mm，θ≈0.003/15=0.0002rad=0.01146°；只描述兩點整體傾斜。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume pivot points15m vertically apart with horizontal offset3mm. Tilt≈0.0002rad=0.01146°, describing only the overall two-point alignment.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「轉軸對位與垂直度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Hinge alignment and plumbness\", which statement holds?","options":["油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。"],"optionsEn":["Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b294-v15-23","title":"轉軸對位與垂直度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Hinge alignment and plumbness: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「轉軸對位與垂直度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Hinge alignment and plumbness” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以獨立控制點重測上下與中間位置，保存溫度和受力狀態，分開整體傾斜與局部殘差。將對位結果連回接觸痕跡及低速受控測試紀錄，由正式程序評估，不以本例角度當允差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Resurvey upper, intermediate and lower points from independent control with temperature and loading recorded. Separate global tilt from local residuals and relate alignment to contact evidence and approved controlled-test records, without using the illustrative angle as a field tolerance. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：以獨立控制點重測上下與中間位置，保存溫度和受力狀態，分開整體傾斜與局部殘差。將對位結果連回接觸痕跡及低速受控測試紀錄，由正式程序評估，不以本例角度當允差。","observationEn":"Site practice: Resurvey upper, intermediate and lower points from independent control with temperature and loading recorded. Separate global tilt from local residuals and relate alignment to contact evidence and approved controlled-test records, without using the illustrative angle as a field tolerance.","failure":"注意干擾：共同基準移動會使所有測點看似對齊，兩點吻合也可能漏掉中間彎曲。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Moving common control can make all points appear aligned, and matching endpoints may conceal intermediate curvature. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以獨立控制點重測上下與中間位置，保存溫度和受力狀態，分開整體傾斜與局部殘差。將對位結果連回接觸痕跡及低速受控測試紀錄，由正式程序評估，不以本例角度當允差。","textEn":"Resurvey upper, intermediate and lower points from independent control with temperature and loading recorded. Separate global tilt from local residuals and relate alignment to contact evidence and approved controlled-test records, without using the illustrative angle as a field tolerance.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"以獨立控制點重測上下與中間位置，保存溫度和受力狀態，分開整體傾斜與局部殘差。將對位結果連回接觸痕跡及低速受控測試紀錄，由正式程序評估，不以本例角度當允差。","textEn":"Resurvey upper, intermediate and lower points from independent control with temperature and loading recorded. Separate global tilt from local residuals and relate alignment to contact evidence and approved controlled-test records, without using the illustrative angle as a field tolerance.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「轉軸對位與垂直度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Hinge alignment and plumbness\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。","以獨立控制點重測上下與中間位置，保存溫度和受力狀態，分開整體傾斜與局部殘差。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress.","Resurvey upper, intermediate and lower points from independent control with temperature and loading recorded."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以獨立控制點重測上下與中間位置，保存溫度和受力狀態，分開整體傾斜與局部殘差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Resurvey upper, intermediate and lower points from independent control with temperature and loading recorded. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b294-v15-24","title":"轉軸對位與垂直度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Hinge alignment and plumbness: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「轉軸對位與垂直度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Hinge alignment and plumbness” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"共同基準移動會使所有測點看似對齊，兩點吻合也可能漏掉中間彎曲。若直接調整一端去補償錯誤測量，可能使原本良好的支承接觸受到額外偏載。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Moving common control can make all points appear aligned, and matching endpoints may conceal intermediate curvature. Adjusting one end to compensate for an erroneous survey can impose extra eccentric loading on previously satisfactory bearing contact. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設上下測點高差15m、水平偏移3mm，θ≈0.003/15=0.0002rad=0.01146°；只描述兩點整體傾斜。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Tilt≈0.0002rad=0.01146°, describing only the overall two-point alignment.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"共同基準移動會使所有測點看似對齊，兩點吻合也可能漏掉中間彎曲。若直接調整一端去補償錯誤測量，可能使原本良好的支承接觸受到額外偏載。","textEn":"Moving common control can make all points appear aligned, and matching endpoints may conceal intermediate curvature. Adjusting one end to compensate for an erroneous survey can impose extra eccentric loading on previously satisfactory bearing contact.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「轉軸對位與垂直度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Hinge alignment and plumbness\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["共同基準移動會使所有測點看似對齊，兩點吻合也可能漏掉中間彎曲。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。"],"optionsEn":["Moving common control can make all points appear aligned, and matching endpoints may conceal intermediate curvature.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"共同基準移動會使所有測點看似對齊，兩點吻合也可能漏掉中間彎曲。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Moving common control can make all points appear aligned, and matching endpoints may conceal intermediate curvature. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b294-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「熱伸縮與安裝基準」與「致動器力臂幾何」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Thermal movement and installation reference\" and \"Actuator lever-arm geometry\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b294-v15-25","title":"熱伸縮與安裝基準：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Thermal movement and installation reference: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「熱伸縮與安裝基準」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Thermal movement and installation reference” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"大型鋼門的溫度變化會改變尺寸，陽照造成的梯度還可能使面板翹曲。均勻自由膨脹只提供基本量級，約束與不同材料埋件會產生額外內力；安裝測量若不記溫度，跨日對比可能把可逆伸縮當作製造或定位誤差。 假設鋼α=12×10⁻⁶/K、長15m、均勻升溫20K，自由伸長αLΔT=3.60mm；不含溫度梯度或約束應力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「熱伸縮與安裝基準」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Temperature changes alter large steel-gate dimensions, while solar gradients can warp panels. Uniform free expansion supplies only a baseline; restraint and dissimilar embedded materials generate additional forces. Without temperature records, surveys on different days may mistake reversible thermal movement for fabrication or positioning error, leading to inappropriate adjustment of dimensions that are correct at the intended reference condition. Assume steelα=12×10⁻⁶/K,length15m and uniform warming20K. Free expansion is3.60mm, excluding gradients and restraint stresses. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal movement and installation reference” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「熱伸縮與安裝基準」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Thermal movement and installation reference”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-25-k1","title":"熱伸縮與安裝基準","titleEn":"Thermal movement and installation reference","text":"大型鋼門的溫度變化會改變尺寸，陽照造成的梯度還可能使面板翹曲。均勻自由膨脹只提供基本量級，約束與不同材料埋件會產生額外內力；安裝測量若不記溫度，跨日對比可能把可逆伸縮當作製造或定位誤差。","textEn":"Temperature changes alter large steel-gate dimensions, while solar gradients can warp panels. Uniform free expansion supplies only a baseline; restraint and dissimilar embedded materials generate additional forces.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「熱伸縮與安裝基準」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Thermal movement and installation reference\" is correct?","options":["氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。","大型鋼門的溫度變化會改變尺寸，陽照造成的梯度還可能使面板翹曲。","致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。"],"optionsEn":["Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate.","Temperature changes alter large steel-gate dimensions, while solar gradients can warp panels.","The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction."],"answer":1,"explanation":"大型鋼門的溫度變化會改變尺寸，陽照造成的梯度還可能使面板翹曲。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Temperature changes alter large steel-gate dimensions, while solar gradients can warp panels. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b294-v15-26","title":"熱伸縮與安裝基準：定量估算","titleEn":"Thermal movement and installation reference: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「熱伸縮與安裝基準」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Thermal movement and installation reference” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設鋼α=12×10⁻⁶/K、長15m、均勻升溫20K，自由伸長αLΔT=3.60mm；不含溫度梯度或約束應力。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume steelα=12×10⁻⁶/K,length15m and uniform warming20K. Free expansion is3.60mm, excluding gradients and restraint stresses. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：記錄量測時鋼材各位置溫度與參考溫度，先分辨均勻變化和日照梯度再作尺寸比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record steel temperatures at several positions and the reference temperature, separating uniform change from solar gradients before comparing dimensions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設鋼α=12×10⁻⁶/K、長15m、均勻升溫20K，自由伸長αLΔT=3.60mm；不含溫度梯度或約束應力。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume steelα=12×10⁻⁶/K,length15m and uniform warming20K. Free expansion is3.60mm, excluding gradients and restraint stresses.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「熱伸縮與安裝基準」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Thermal movement and installation reference\", which statement holds?","options":["修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。","門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head.","Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b294-v15-27","title":"熱伸縮與安裝基準：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Thermal movement and installation reference: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「熱伸縮與安裝基準」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal movement and installation reference” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"記錄量測時鋼材各位置溫度與參考溫度，先分辨均勻變化和日照梯度再作尺寸比較。將接觸約束和實際位移一起檢查，避免為消除可逆熱變形而永久改動安裝對位。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record steel temperatures at several positions and the reference temperature, separating uniform change from solar gradients before comparing dimensions. Check restraint and actual movement together, avoiding permanent alignment changes intended merely to remove a reversible thermal deformation. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：記錄量測時鋼材各位置溫度與參考溫度，先分辨均勻變化和日照梯度再作尺寸比較。將接觸約束和實際位移一起檢查，避免為消除可逆熱變形而永久改動安裝對位。","observationEn":"Site practice: Record steel temperatures at several positions and the reference temperature, separating uniform change from solar gradients before comparing dimensions. Check restraint and actual movement together, avoiding permanent alignment changes intended merely to remove a reversible thermal deformation.","failure":"注意干擾：單點氣溫不一定代表鋼板溫度，迎陽與背陰面差異又可能造成彎曲。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Air temperature at one point may not represent steel temperature, and sun-shade differences can cause curvature. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"記錄量測時鋼材各位置溫度與參考溫度，先分辨均勻變化和日照梯度再作尺寸比較。將接觸約束和實際位移一起檢查，避免為消除可逆熱變形而永久改動安裝對位。","textEn":"Record steel temperatures at several positions and the reference temperature, separating uniform change from solar gradients before comparing dimensions. Check restraint and actual movement together, avoiding permanent alignment changes intended merely to remove a reversible thermal deformation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"記錄量測時鋼材各位置溫度與參考溫度，先分辨均勻變化和日照梯度再作尺寸比較。將接觸約束和實際位移一起檢查，避免為消除可逆熱變形而永久改動安裝對位。","textEn":"Record steel temperatures at several positions and the reference temperature, separating uniform change from solar gradients before comparing dimensions. Check restraint and actual movement together, avoiding permanent alignment changes intended merely to remove a reversible thermal deformation.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「熱伸縮與安裝基準」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Thermal movement and installation reference\"?","options":["記錄量測時鋼材各位置溫度與參考溫度，先分辨均勻變化和日照梯度再作尺寸比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。"],"optionsEn":["Record steel temperatures at several positions and the reference temperature, separating uniform change from solar gradients before comparing dimensions.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"記錄量測時鋼材各位置溫度與參考溫度，先分辨均勻變化和日照梯度再作尺寸比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record steel temperatures at several positions and the reference temperature, separating uniform change from solar gradients before comparing dimensions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b294-v15-28","title":"熱伸縮與安裝基準：失效診斷","titleEn":"Thermal movement and installation reference: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「熱伸縮與安裝基準」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thermal movement and installation reference” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"單點氣溫不一定代表鋼板溫度，迎陽與背陰面差異又可能造成彎曲。若忽略這些條件，晨間可閉合而午後卡阻的問題可能被錯誤歸因為機械故障。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Air temperature at one point may not represent steel temperature, and sun-shade differences can cause curvature. Ignoring these conditions may misdiagnose a gate that closes in the morning but binds later as a machinery failure. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設鋼α=12×10⁻⁶/K、長15m、均勻升溫20K，自由伸長αLΔT=3.60mm；不含溫度梯度或約束應力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Free expansion is3.60mm, excluding gradients and restraint stresses.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"單點氣溫不一定代表鋼板溫度，迎陽與背陰面差異又可能造成彎曲。若忽略這些條件，晨間可閉合而午後卡阻的問題可能被錯誤歸因為機械故障。","textEn":"Air temperature at one point may not represent steel temperature, and sun-shade differences can cause curvature. Ignoring these conditions may misdiagnose a gate that closes in the morning but binds later as a machinery failure.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「熱伸縮與安裝基準」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Thermal movement and installation reference\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","單點氣溫不一定代表鋼板溫度，迎陽與背陰面差異又可能造成彎曲。","致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Air temperature at one point may not represent steel temperature, and sun-shade differences can cause curvature.","The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction."],"answer":1,"explanation":"單點氣溫不一定代表鋼板溫度，迎陽與背陰面差異又可能造成彎曲。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Air temperature at one point may not represent steel temperature, and sun-shade differences can cause curvature. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b294-v15-29","title":"致動器力臂幾何：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Actuator lever-arm geometry: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「致動器力臂幾何」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Actuator lever-arm geometry” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"啟閉機推力透過連桿和轉軸形成力矩，垂直力臂才是有效距離，幾何接近共線時需求可能迅速上升。假定阻力矩固定只用於辨識幾何敏感度，實際摩擦、水力及慣性隨位置變化；不能由單點力矩平衡自行推定完整操作或保護設定。 假設指定阻力矩200kN·m、連接半徑2m、力向與半徑30°，F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN；非實際啟閉設定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「致動器力臂幾何」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Actuator force produces torque through the perpendicular lever arm, with demand rising as linkage geometry approaches alignment. A fixed resisting torque isolates geometry sensitivity only; actual friction, hydraulic action and inertia vary with position. One equilibrium point therefore cannot define the complete operating sequence, permissible thrust or protective settings for the machinery connected to the gate. Assume selected resisting torque200kN·m,radius2m and force-radius angle30°. F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN, not an operating setting. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Actuator lever-arm geometry” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「致動器力臂幾何」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Actuator lever-arm geometry”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-29-k1","title":"致動器力臂幾何","titleEn":"Actuator lever-arm geometry","text":"啟閉機推力透過連桿和轉軸形成力矩，垂直力臂才是有效距離，幾何接近共線時需求可能迅速上升。假定阻力矩固定只用於辨識幾何敏感度，實際摩擦、水力及慣性隨位置變化；不能由單點力矩平衡自行推定完整操作或保護設定。","textEn":"Actuator force produces torque through the perpendicular lever arm, with demand rising as linkage geometry approaches alignment. A fixed resisting torque isolates geometry sensitivity only; actual friction, hydraulic action and inertia vary with position.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「致動器力臂幾何」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Actuator lever-arm geometry\" is correct?","options":["致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。","油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。","啟閉機推力透過連桿和轉軸形成力矩，垂直力臂才是有效距離，幾何接近共線時需求可能迅速上升。"],"optionsEn":["The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction.","Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight.","Actuator force produces torque through the perpendicular lever arm, with demand rising as linkage geometry approaches alignment."],"answer":2,"explanation":"啟閉機推力透過連桿和轉軸形成力矩，垂直力臂才是有效距離，幾何接近共線時需求可能迅速上升。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Actuator force produces torque through the perpendicular lever arm, with demand rising as linkage geometry approaches alignment. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b294-v15-30","title":"致動器力臂幾何：定量估算","titleEn":"Actuator lever-arm geometry: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「致動器力臂幾何」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Actuator lever-arm geometry” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設指定阻力矩200kN·m、連接半徑2m、力向與半徑30°，F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN；非實際啟閉設定。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume selected resisting torque200kN·m,radius2m and force-radius angle30°. F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN, not an operating setting. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用實際樞點坐標畫不同門角的力臂，核對角度是在力向與半徑之間，檢查接近死點的區段。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Plot lever arms at several gate angles using actual pivot coordinates and verify the force-radius angle, checking near-toggle regions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設指定阻力矩200kN·m、連接半徑2m、力向與半徑30°，F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN；非實際啟閉設定。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume selected resisting torque200kN·m,radius2m and force-radius angle30°. F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN, not an operating setting.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「致動器力臂幾何」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Actuator lever-arm geometry\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。","整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis.","Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b294-v15-31","title":"致動器力臂幾何：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Actuator lever-arm geometry: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「致動器力臂幾何」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Actuator lever-arm geometry” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用實際樞點坐標畫不同門角的力臂，核對角度是在力向與半徑之間，檢查接近死點的區段。將量測力矩與摩擦水力分量對照，依核准資料驗證全行程，不只驗算中間位置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Plot lever arms at several gate angles using actual pivot coordinates and verify the force-radius angle, checking near-toggle regions. Compare measured torque with friction and hydraulic contributions and validate the full stroke against approved data rather than checking only a convenient intermediate position. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用實際樞點坐標畫不同門角的力臂，核對角度是在力向與半徑之間，檢查接近死點的區段。將量測力矩與摩擦水力分量對照，依核准資料驗證全行程，不只驗算中間位置。","observationEn":"Site practice: Plot lever arms at several gate angles using actual pivot coordinates and verify the force-radius angle, checking near-toggle regions. Compare measured torque with friction and hydraulic contributions and validate the full stroke against approved data rather than checking only a convenient intermediate position.","failure":"注意干擾：把連桿長直接當垂直力臂會低估斜向位置的推力，銷軸磨耗又可能改變幾何和摩擦。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using link length as perpendicular arm understates force in oblique positions, and pin wear changes geometry and friction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用實際樞點坐標畫不同門角的力臂，核對角度是在力向與半徑之間，檢查接近死點的區段。將量測力矩與摩擦水力分量對照，依核准資料驗證全行程，不只驗算中間位置。","textEn":"Plot lever arms at several gate angles using actual pivot coordinates and verify the force-radius angle, checking near-toggle regions. Compare measured torque with friction and hydraulic contributions and validate the full stroke against approved data rather than checking only a convenient intermediate position.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用實際樞點坐標畫不同門角的力臂，核對角度是在力向與半徑之間，檢查接近死點的區段。將量測力矩與摩擦水力分量對照，依核准資料驗證全行程，不只驗算中間位置。","textEn":"Plot lever arms at several gate angles using actual pivot coordinates and verify the force-radius angle, checking near-toggle regions. Compare measured torque with friction and hydraulic contributions and validate the full stroke against approved data rather than checking only a convenient intermediate position.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「致動器力臂幾何」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Actuator lever-arm geometry\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","用實際樞點坐標畫不同門角的力臂，核對角度是在力向與半徑之間，檢查接近死點的區段。","名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Plot lever arms at several gate angles using actual pivot coordinates and verify the force-radius angle, checking near-toggle regions.","Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用實際樞點坐標畫不同門角的力臂，核對角度是在力向與半徑之間，檢查接近死點的區段。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Plot lever arms at several gate angles using actual pivot coordinates and verify the force-radius angle, checking near-toggle regions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b294-v15-32","title":"致動器力臂幾何：失效診斷","titleEn":"Actuator lever-arm geometry: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「致動器力臂幾何」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Actuator lever-arm geometry” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把連桿長直接當垂直力臂會低估斜向位置的推力，銷軸磨耗又可能改變幾何和摩擦。中間行程符合計算，仍不能排除端部接近共線時的高需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using link length as perpendicular arm understates force in oblique positions, and pin wear changes geometry and friction. Agreement at midstroke does not exclude high demand near an aligned linkage at the end of travel. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設指定阻力矩200kN·m、連接半徑2m、力向與半徑30°，F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN；非實際啟閉設定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: F=M/(r sinθ)=200kN, not an operating setting.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「致動器力臂永遠等於連接半徑而不受門角和力向影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The effective actuator lever arm always equals its radius regardless of gate angle and force direction.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把連桿長直接當垂直力臂會低估斜向位置的推力，銷軸磨耗又可能改變幾何和摩擦。中間行程符合計算，仍不能排除端部接近共線時的高需求。","textEn":"Using link length as perpendicular arm understates force in oblique positions, and pin wear changes geometry and friction. Agreement at midstroke does not exclude high demand near an aligned linkage at the end of travel.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「致動器力臂幾何」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Actuator lever-arm geometry\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。","把連桿長直接當垂直力臂會低估斜向位置的推力，銷軸磨耗又可能改變幾何和摩擦。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight.","Using link length as perpendicular arm understates force in oblique positions, and pin wear changes geometry and friction."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把連桿長直接當垂直力臂會低估斜向位置的推力，銷軸磨耗又可能改變幾何和摩擦。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using link length as perpendicular arm understates force in oblique positions, and pin wear changes geometry and friction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b294-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「油壓缸理想推力」與「止水漏流與證據」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust\" and \"Seal leakage and evidence\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b294-v15-33","title":"油壓缸理想推力：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「油壓缸理想推力」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"油壓推力由兩腔壓力與有效面積共同決定，伸出與回縮面積不同，背壓及摩擦不能隨意忽略。單腔理想式可核對量級，但不包含閥路動態、洩漏和機械效率；壓力達到某數值也不能證明門葉正在按預期位置移動，需要獨立位移證據。 假設缸徑0.16m、無背壓與摩擦、缸底壓10MPa，F=pπD²/4=201.062kN；回縮需扣活塞桿面積。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「油壓缸理想推力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Cylinder force depends on both chamber pressures and effective areas, which differ during extension and retraction. Backpressure and friction cannot generally be ignored. A single-chamber idealization checks scale but omits valve dynamics, leakage and efficiency. Reaching a pressure value does not prove that the gate has reached its intended position; independent displacement evidence is also required. Assume bore0.16m,cap pressure10MPa and no backpressure or friction. Ideal F=pπD²/4=201.062kN; retraction requires rod-area deduction. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「油壓缸理想推力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-33-k1","title":"油壓缸理想推力","titleEn":"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust","text":"油壓推力由兩腔壓力與有效面積共同決定，伸出與回縮面積不同，背壓及摩擦不能隨意忽略。單腔理想式可核對量級，但不包含閥路動態、洩漏和機械效率；壓力達到某數值也不能證明門葉正在按預期位置移動，需要獨立位移證據。","textEn":"Cylinder force depends on both chamber pressures and effective areas, which differ during extension and retraction. Backpressure and friction cannot generally be ignored.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「油壓缸理想推力」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust\" is correct?","options":["油壓推力由兩腔壓力與有效面積共同決定，伸出與回縮面積不同，背壓及摩擦不能隨意忽略。","油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。","修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。"],"optionsEn":["Cylinder force depends on both chamber pressures and effective areas, which differ during extension and retraction.","Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight.","Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head."],"answer":0,"explanation":"油壓推力由兩腔壓力與有效面積共同決定，伸出與回縮面積不同，背壓及摩擦不能隨意忽略。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Cylinder force depends on both chamber pressures and effective areas, which differ during extension and retraction. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b294-v15-34","title":"油壓缸理想推力：定量估算","titleEn":"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「油壓缸理想推力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設缸徑0.16m、無背壓與摩擦、缸底壓10MPa，F=pπD²/4=201.062kN；回縮需扣活塞桿面積。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume bore0.16m,cap pressure10MPa and no backpressure or friction. Ideal F=pπD²/4=201.062kN; retraction requires rod-area deduction. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步讀取兩腔壓力與活塞位置，核對缸徑、桿徑和壓力單位，分開計算伸縮方向。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Read both chamber pressures and piston position together, checking bore, rod size and units for each direction.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設缸徑0.16m、無背壓與摩擦、缸底壓10MPa，F=pπD²/4=201.062kN；回縮需扣活塞桿面積。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume bore0.16m,cap pressure10MPa and no backpressure or friction. Ideal F=pπD²/4=201.062kN; retraction requires rod-area deduction.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「油壓缸理想推力」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust\", which statement holds?","options":["門葉實長永遠等於船閘淨寬的一半而不受斜角影響。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","排水後門葉支承仍只承受與完全浸水時相同的有效重量。"],"optionsEn":["Each miter leaf length always equals half the clear lock width regardless of its angle.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","After dewatering, supports carry only the same effective weight as during full submergence."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b294-v15-35","title":"油壓缸理想推力：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「油壓缸理想推力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步讀取兩腔壓力與活塞位置，核對缸徑、桿徑和壓力單位，分開計算伸縮方向。用負載與位移紀錄辨識內漏或卡阻，依設備文件評估，不把理想推力當成可任意提高壓力的理由。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Read both chamber pressures and piston position together, checking bore, rod size and units for each direction. Use load and motion records to identify leakage or binding under equipment documentation, without treating ideal thrust as justification for arbitrarily raising pressure. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：同步讀取兩腔壓力與活塞位置，核對缸徑、桿徑和壓力單位，分開計算伸縮方向。用負載與位移紀錄辨識內漏或卡阻，依設備文件評估，不把理想推力當成可任意提高壓力的理由。","observationEn":"Site practice: Read both chamber pressures and piston position together, checking bore, rod size and units for each direction. Use load and motion records to identify leakage or binding under equipment documentation, without treating ideal thrust as justification for arbitrarily raising pressure.","failure":"注意干擾：回油背壓存在時只用缸底壓會高估淨力，卡阻又可造成壓力高但門不動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ignoring return backpressure overstates net force, while binding produces high pressure without gate movement. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步讀取兩腔壓力與活塞位置，核對缸徑、桿徑和壓力單位，分開計算伸縮方向。用負載與位移紀錄辨識內漏或卡阻，依設備文件評估，不把理想推力當成可任意提高壓力的理由。","textEn":"Read both chamber pressures and piston position together, checking bore, rod size and units for each direction. Use load and motion records to identify leakage or binding under equipment documentation, without treating ideal thrust as justification for arbitrarily raising pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"同步讀取兩腔壓力與活塞位置，核對缸徑、桿徑和壓力單位，分開計算伸縮方向。用負載與位移紀錄辨識內漏或卡阻，依設備文件評估，不把理想推力當成可任意提高壓力的理由。","textEn":"Read both chamber pressures and piston position together, checking bore, rod size and units for each direction. Use load and motion records to identify leakage or binding under equipment documentation, without treating ideal thrust as justification for arbitrarily raising pressure.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「油壓缸理想推力」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","上下兩點量測吻合就可以排除軸線所有彎曲和局部錯位。","同步讀取兩腔壓力與活塞位置，核對缸徑、桿徑和壓力單位，分開計算伸縮方向。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Matching two pivot endpoints excludes all shaft curvature and local misalignment.","Read both chamber pressures and piston position together, checking bore, rod size and units for each direction."],"answer":2,"explanation":"同步讀取兩腔壓力與活塞位置，核對缸徑、桿徑和壓力單位，分開計算伸縮方向。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Read both chamber pressures and piston position together, checking bore, rod size and units for each direction. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b294-v15-36","title":"油壓缸理想推力：失效診斷","titleEn":"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「油壓缸理想推力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"回油背壓存在時只用缸底壓會高估淨力，卡阻又可造成壓力高但門不動。若控制系統只看壓力完成訊號，便可能把機械未到位誤判成已閉合。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ignoring return backpressure overstates net force, while binding produces high pressure without gate movement. A controller relying only on a pressure-completion signal may therefore misidentify an unseated gate as properly closed in the required position. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設缸徑0.16m、無背壓與摩擦、缸底壓10MPa，F=pπD²/4=201.062kN；回縮需扣活塞桿面積。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Ideal F=pπD²/4=201.062kN; retraction requires rod-area deduction.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「油壓達到設定值就能單獨證明門葉已完全到位和止水。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Reaching hydraulic pressure alone proves that the gate is fully seated and watertight.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"回油背壓存在時只用缸底壓會高估淨力，卡阻又可造成壓力高但門不動。若控制系統只看壓力完成訊號，便可能把機械未到位誤判成已閉合。","textEn":"Ignoring return backpressure overstates net force, while binding produces high pressure without gate movement. A controller relying only on a pressure-completion signal may therefore misidentify an unseated gate as properly closed in the required position.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「油壓缸理想推力」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Ideal hydraulic-cylinder thrust\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["回油背壓存在時只用缸底壓會高估淨力，卡阻又可造成壓力高但門不動。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。"],"optionsEn":["Ignoring return backpressure overstates net force, while binding produces high pressure without gate movement.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head."],"answer":0,"explanation":"回油背壓存在時只用缸底壓會高估淨力，卡阻又可造成壓力高但門不動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ignoring return backpressure overstates net force, while binding produces high pressure without gate movement. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b294-v15-37","title":"止水漏流與證據：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Seal leakage and evidence: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「止水漏流與證據」如何影響船閘人字門安裝的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Seal leakage and evidence” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Miter-gate installation for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"閉合止水的功能需要在明定水頭下量測漏流，看到接觸不等於所有位置都密合。等效孔口模型只用來比較缺口尺度，狹縫黏性流與粗糙通道可能不同；隨水頭改變的漏水曲線、接觸印痕與對位資料應一起判讀，不能只用一次總漏量找原因。 假設等效孔口A=0.002m²、Cd=0.60、水頭2m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s；非允許漏量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「止水漏流與證據」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Seal function requires leakage observations at a defined head; visible contact does not prove continuous sealing. An equivalent orifice only compares gap scales, while viscous slots and rough pathways behave differently. Leakage versus head, contact evidence and alignment must be interpreted together, because one total-flow measurement cannot uniquely locate a defect or determine its physical cause. Assume equivalent opening0.002m²,Cd=0.60 and head2m. Q=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s, not an allowable leakage limit. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Seal leakage and evidence” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「止水漏流與證據」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Seal leakage and evidence”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-37-k1","title":"止水漏流與證據","titleEn":"Seal leakage and evidence","text":"閉合止水的功能需要在明定水頭下量測漏流，看到接觸不等於所有位置都密合。等效孔口模型只用來比較缺口尺度，狹縫黏性流與粗糙通道可能不同；隨水頭改變的漏水曲線、接觸印痕與對位資料應一起判讀，不能只用一次總漏量找原因。","textEn":"Seal function requires leakage observations at a defined head; visible contact does not prove continuous sealing. An equivalent orifice only compares gap scales, while viscous slots and rough pathways behave differently.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「止水漏流與證據」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Seal leakage and evidence\" is correct?","options":["修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。","閉合止水的功能需要在明定水頭下量測漏流，看到接觸不等於所有位置都密合。","閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。"],"optionsEn":["Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head.","Seal function requires leakage observations at a defined head; visible contact does not prove continuous sealing.","The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis."],"answer":1,"explanation":"閉合止水的功能需要在明定水頭下量測漏流，看到接觸不等於所有位置都密合。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Seal function requires leakage observations at a defined head; visible contact does not prove continuous sealing. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b294-v15-38","title":"止水漏流與證據：定量估算","titleEn":"Seal leakage and evidence: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「止水漏流與證據」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Seal leakage and evidence” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設等效孔口A=0.002m²、Cd=0.60、水頭2m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s；非允許漏量。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume equivalent opening0.002m²,Cd=0.60 and head2m. Q=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s, not an allowable leakage limit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：分區記錄漏水位置和壓差，核對計量是否包含其他排水路徑，並同步保存門位與接觸證據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record leak location and pressure difference by zone, checking whether measurements include other drains and retaining gate position and contact evidence.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設等效孔口A=0.002m²、Cd=0.60、水頭2m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s；非允許漏量。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume equivalent opening0.002m²,Cd=0.60 and head2m. Q=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s, not an allowable leakage limit.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「止水漏流與證據」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Seal leakage and evidence\", which statement holds?","options":["整扇門位移很小即可證明所有面板局部彎曲應力都很小。","名義平均承壓就是軸承每個接觸點的實際最大壓力。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["Small whole-gate displacement proves that every skin panel has low local bending stress.","Nominal average bearing pressure equals the actual maximum pressure at every contact point.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b294-v15-39","title":"止水漏流與證據：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Seal leakage and evidence: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「止水漏流與證據」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Seal leakage and evidence” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"分區記錄漏水位置和壓差，核對計量是否包含其他排水路徑，並同步保存門位與接觸證據。比較不同水頭下曲線形狀，先判斷孔口近似是否成立，再依正式要求評估修復成效。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record leak location and pressure difference by zone, checking whether measurements include other drains and retaining gate position and contact evidence. Compare curve shape across heads, test the orifice approximation first and assess repair performance against the actual approved requirements. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：分區記錄漏水位置和壓差，核對計量是否包含其他排水路徑，並同步保存門位與接觸證據。比較不同水頭下曲線形狀，先判斷孔口近似是否成立，再依正式要求評估修復成效。","observationEn":"Site practice: Record leak location and pressure difference by zone, checking whether measurements include other drains and retaining gate position and contact evidence. Compare curve shape across heads, test the orifice approximation first and assess repair performance against the actual approved requirements.","failure":"注意干擾：另一排水支路混入會高估止水漏量，局部長縫又可能不符合孔口係數。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: An unrelated drain inflates measured seal leakage, while a long narrow slot may not fit the orifice coefficient. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"分區記錄漏水位置和壓差，核對計量是否包含其他排水路徑，並同步保存門位與接觸證據。比較不同水頭下曲線形狀，先判斷孔口近似是否成立，再依正式要求評估修復成效。","textEn":"Record leak location and pressure difference by zone, checking whether measurements include other drains and retaining gate position and contact evidence. Compare curve shape across heads, test the orifice approximation first and assess repair performance against the actual approved requirements.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"分區記錄漏水位置和壓差，核對計量是否包含其他排水路徑，並同步保存門位與接觸證據。比較不同水頭下曲線形狀，先判斷孔口近似是否成立，再依正式要求評估修復成效。","textEn":"Record leak location and pressure difference by zone, checking whether measurements include other drains and retaining gate position and contact evidence. Compare curve shape across heads, test the orifice approximation first and assess repair performance against the actual approved requirements.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「止水漏流與證據」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Seal leakage and evidence\"?","options":["分區記錄漏水位置和壓差，核對計量是否包含其他排水路徑，並同步保存門位與接觸證據。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","氣溫相同就代表整扇鋼門溫度均勻而不會發生熱彎曲。"],"optionsEn":["Record leak location and pressure difference by zone, checking whether measurements include other drains and retaining gate position and contact evidence.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Equal air temperature proves uniform steel temperature and rules out thermal bending of the gate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"分區記錄漏水位置和壓差，核對計量是否包含其他排水路徑，並同步保存門位與接觸證據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record leak location and pressure difference by zone, checking whether measurements include other drains and retaining gate position and contact evidence. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b294-v15-40","title":"止水漏流與證據：失效診斷","titleEn":"Seal leakage and evidence: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"prerequisiteIds":["b294-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「止水漏流與證據」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Seal leakage and evidence” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"另一排水支路混入會高估止水漏量，局部長縫又可能不符合孔口係數。修復後總流量下降若源自水頭下降，不能被誤當成止水接觸已真正改善。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"An unrelated drain inflates measured seal leakage, while a long narrow slot may not fit the orifice coefficient. Lower total flow after repair can simply reflect lower head rather than genuinely improved contact along the seal. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設等效孔口A=0.002m²、Cd=0.60、水頭2m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s；非允許漏量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Q=0.007517m³/s=7.517L/s, not an allowable leakage limit.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「修復後總漏水變少就必然代表止水改善而不必核對水頭。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Less total leakage after repair necessarily proves a better seal without checking the water head.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b294-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"另一排水支路混入會高估止水漏量，局部長縫又可能不符合孔口係數。修復後總流量下降若源自水頭下降，不能被誤當成止水接觸已真正改善。","textEn":"An unrelated drain inflates measured seal leakage, while a long narrow slot may not fit the orifice coefficient. Lower total flow after repair can simply reflect lower head rather than genuinely improved contact along the seal.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]},{"id":"b294-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「止水漏流與證據」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Seal leakage and evidence\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","另一排水支路混入會高估止水漏量，局部長縫又可能不符合孔口係數。","閉門靜水合力可以不經力路徑分析直接當成啟閉機推力。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","An unrelated drain inflates measured seal leakage, while a long narrow slot may not fit the orifice coefficient.","The closed-gate hydrostatic resultant directly equals actuator thrust without load-path analysis."],"answer":1,"explanation":"另一排水支路混入會高估止水漏量，局部長縫又可能不符合孔口係數。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An unrelated drain inflates measured seal leakage, while a long narrow slot may not fit the orifice coefficient. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-hss","v7-panama-original","v15s-usace-mechanical","v7-panama-gates","v15s-wilson"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
